        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The War for Tomorrow Begins in Your Hangar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has fallen silent. The once-great colonies are now tombs of steel, overrun by a merciless steel legion. As a veteran combat specialist, you are thrust into the heart of the conflict—the last spark of resistance against the cold, calculating darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal of Retribution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a devastating array of sci-fi weaponry. Incinerate waves of drones with a plasma rifle, punch through armored cores with a rocket launcher or disintegrate foes with energy-based shotguns. Find your favorite, then make it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory earns you credits. Spend them in your mobile hangar, the heart of your operation. This is where a soldier becomes a legend. Augment your combat suit with enhanced shields, jet-powered dodges, and reactive armor. Upgrade your weapons with faster fire rates and larger magazines. Every upgrade is a step toward tipping the scales of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles are the same. The steel threat is diverse and relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm enemy strongholds with a single objective: total destruction of all hostiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend vital resistance bases against overwhelming waves of attackers. Hold the line, or everything is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan Slayer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against colossal boss machines, each with unique, earth-shattering attacks and devastating weak points. These epic encounters will test every upgrade and skill you possess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Third-Person Combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, fluid shooting with a tactical edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive upgrades  in your personal hangar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle agile drones, heavy assault robots, and screen-filling boss titans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Mission Types.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilation, base defense, and epic boss battles across multiple sci-fi landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Arsenal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master a wide variety of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine war waits for no one. Suit up, soldier. The future needs a champion.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The War for Tomorrow Begins in Your Hangar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has fallen silent. The once-great colonies are now tombs of steel, overrun by a merciless steel legion. As a veteran combat specialist, you are thrust into the heart of the conflict—the last spark of resistance against the cold, calculating darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal of Retribution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a devastating array of sci-fi weaponry. Incinerate waves of drones with a plasma rifle, punch through armored cores with a rocket launcher or disintegrate foes with energy-based shotguns. Find your favorite, then make it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory earns you credits. Spend them in your mobile hangar, the heart of your operation. This is where a soldier becomes a legend. Augment your combat suit with enhanced shields, jet-powered dodges, and reactive armor. Upgrade your weapons with faster fire rates and larger magazines. Every upgrade is a step toward tipping the scales of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles are the same. The steel threat is diverse and relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm enemy strongholds with a single objective: total destruction of all hostiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend vital resistance bases against overwhelming waves of attackers. Hold the line, or everything is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titan Slayer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against colossal boss machines, each with unique, earth-shattering attacks and devastating weak points. These epic encounters will test every upgrade and skill you possess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Third-Person Combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, fluid shooting with a tactical edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive upgrades  in your personal hangar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle agile drones, heavy assault robots, and screen-filling boss titans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Mission Types.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilation, base defense, and epic boss battles across multiple sci-fi landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Arsenal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master a wide variety of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine war waits for no one. Suit up, soldier. The future needs a champion.</p>",
        "short_description": "Become humanity's last hope. Gear up, upgrade, and unleash hell in a relentless third-person sci-fi shooter against a ruthless robotic army. The future is yours to forge in fire and steel.",
